<title>USA: Logicon sets special meeting for July 29.</title>
<headline>Logicon sets special meeting for July 29.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Logicon Inc said the rescheduled special meeting of stockholders of Logicon to vote on the proposed merger with Northrop Grumman Corp has been set for July 29 in Los Angeles.</p>
<p>It had postponed the meeting, originally set for July 17, becuase it was advised that the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission has requested that it include in its proxy statement/prospectus financial data about Northrop's proposed merger with Lockheed Martin Corp.</p>
</text>
